ection_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:213410953,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:0,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:5143893,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Think &amp; Hack &quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QSaK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F69c4a021-3c37-4c89-93bc-ff7d25d01c6c_1280x1280.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\"><p><strong>¿Quieres aprender a construir algo así?</strong><br>En septiembre abriré un curso donde veremos cómo montar agentes autónomos con skills, memoria, tareas programadas, permisos y supervisión.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><mark data-color=\"#00ff00\" style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👉 </mark><strong><a href=\"https://ainalluna.com/curso-agentes-autonomos/?utm_source=thinkandhack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=hacki-semana-1&amp;utm_content=hacki-semana-1-final\"><mark data-color=\"#00ff00\" style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Apúntate a la lista de espera</mark></a></strong></p></div><div class=\"pullquote\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>Cuéntamelo. Siempre leo todo.</strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/hacki-semana-1/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Deja un comentario&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/hacki-semana-1/comments\"><span>Deja un comentario</span></a></p></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"imag